{title: Nahi Ye Ho Nahi Sakta}
{artist: Nadeem Shravan Kumar Sanu Sadhana Sargam}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] Nahin yeh ho nahi sakta,        [D] ke teri yaad na aaye
[D] Bina tere kahin bhi dil,        [D] mera ab chain na paaye
Tujhe [G] bhoolne se pehle,        Meri [A] jaan chali [D] jaaye
Tujhe [G] bhoolne se pehle,        Meri [A] jaan chali [D] jaaye
[D] O meri jaan chali [G] jaaye..        O meri [A] jaan chali [D] jaaye..
[D] Agar mujh [A] pe yakeen na [D] ho,        [D] mujhe tum [A] aazma [D] lena
[D] Main tumse [A] pyaar karta [G] hoon,        jahaan [A] chaahe bula [D] lena
[D] Todunga na yeh [G] waade wafaa,        [A] yeh waade [D] wafaa
[D] Main aashiq hoon, deewana hoon,        [D] Koi kya mujhko samjhaye
[D] Nahin yeh ho nahi sakta,        [D] ke teri yaad na aaye
Tujhe [G] bhoolne se pehle,        Meri [A] jaan chali [D] jaaye
[D] O meri jaan chali [G] jaaye..        O meri [A] jaan chali [D] jaaye..
[D] Mohabbat [A] ki hadon se [D] hum,        [D] Chalo aa [A] ge nikal jaa [D] yein
[D] Basa lein [A] ghardilon me [G] hum,        Na [A] duniya ko nazar [D] aayein
[D] Chhup ke sune dhad [G] kanon ki sada,        [A] Dhadkanon ki [D] sadaa..
[D] Meri deewanagi dailbar,        [D] tere sar ki kasam khaye
[D] Nahin yeh ho nahi sakta,        [D] ke teri yaad na aaye
Tujhe [G] bhoolne se pehle,        Meri [A] jaan chali [D] jaaye
